(5711163, 831070, 90495, '<td valign="top">As an ad this is lacking but as a photograph it''s pretty cool. <br/>Reasons why it isn''t ad worthy: Bottle seam is too obvious, can''t see the whole Budweiser word and the bottle is tilted to the right.<br/> <br/>Wonderful capture of that drop, though I would have added yellow dye to the liquid. Gave you a 6 for effort and I know how hard it is to get these shots. :)</td>', 'As an ad this is lacking but as a photograph it''s pretty cool. Reasons why it isn''t ad worthy: Bottle seam is too obvious, can''t see the whole Budweiser word and the bottle is tilted to the right. Wonderful capture of that drop, though I would have added yellow dye to the liquid. Gave you a 6 for effort and I know how hard it is to get these shots. :)', '2009-11-02 19:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
