(5717166, 831076, 33672, '<td valign="top">Really well done. Nice attractive presentation of product. You have got to get rid of blown highlights in front can though.</td>', 'Really well done. Nice attractive presentation of product. You have got to get rid of blown highlights in front can though.', '2009-11-07 01:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717167, 830998, 33672, '<td valign="top">Pure, simple  attractive presentation. All around great ad.</td>', 'Pure, simple  attractive presentation. All around great ad.', '2009-11-07 01:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717484, 830971, 67697, '<td valign="top">The splash looks great and I love the inclusion of the lemon and lime.  Since this is an ad, the only thing I''d want to see different is that the view of the can not be blocked.  Still, nice shot!</td>', 'The splash looks great and I love the inclusion of the lemon and lime.  Since this is an ad, the only thing I''d want to see different is that the view of the can not be blocked.  Still, nice shot!', '2009-11-07 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717485, 830508, 67697, '<td valign="top">This must have been a fun mess to mop up lol.  The splash is awesome and I love the complementary green background.</td>', 'This must have been a fun mess to mop up lol.  The splash is awesome and I love the complementary green background.', '2009-11-07 10:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717487, 831001, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and simple.  Definitely something you''d see in an ad.</td>', 'Beautiful and simple.  Definitely something you''d see in an ad.', '2009-11-07 10:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717490, 830616, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blend of colors.  Why did you choose to keep the base white?  I think I''d like to have seen a more golden color there.</td>', 'Beautiful blend of colors.  Why did you choose to keep the base white?  I think I''d like to have seen a more golden color there.', '2009-11-07 10:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717498, 830164, 67697, '<td valign="top">This makes me laugh.  Love the nervous look on the stuffed animal.  I need to buy this for the groundhogs in the field.  Maybe they will leave the garden alone :P  Cute idea  :)</td>', 'This makes me laugh.  Love the nervous look on the stuffed animal.  I need to buy this for the groundhogs in the field.  Maybe they will leave the garden alone :P  Cute idea  :)', '2009-11-07 10:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717598, 831071, 102019, '<td valign="top">Yes, I woulld definitely buy her... But I think you missed the challenge :)</td>', 'Yes, I woulld definitely buy her... But I think you missed the challenge :)', '2009-11-07 11:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717601, 830611, 102019, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, with this shot, the sea and sky is more interesting than the product, so it just makes me want to go on a vacation.</td>', 'Unfortunately, with this shot, the sea and sky is more interesting than the product, so it just makes me want to go on a vacation.', '2009-11-07 11:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717604, 830562, 102019, '<td valign="top">its a little dark.</td>', 'its a little dark.', '2009-11-07 11:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717607, 830986, 102019, '<td valign="top">I can''t even tell what it is -- how am I supposed to buy it?  You missed the point of the challenge, IMO, however I do like the image so I wasn''t TOO hard on you...</td>', 'I can''t even tell what it is -- how am I supposed to buy it?  You missed the point of the challenge, IMO, however I do like the image so I wasn''t TOO hard on you...', '2009-11-07 11:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717609, 830956, 102019, '<td valign="top">This photo is making me thirsty -- I guess that means its a success :)</td>', 'This photo is making me thirsty -- I guess that means its a success :)', '2009-11-07 11:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717611, 830231, 102019, '<td valign="top">The pumpkin and leaves are more interesting than the beverage, and this photo isn''t making me thirsty.  It does make me want to bake a pumpkin pie, however.</td>', 'The pumpkin and leaves are more interesting than the beverage, and this photo isn''t making me thirsty.  It does make me want to bake a pumpkin pie, however.', '2009-11-07 11:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717614, 830164, 102019, '<td valign="top">What''s with the stuffed animal?  I love the lighting on the toy, and you did a great job with the concept.  The framing feels awkward to me though, I feel as though I''m being pulled in two separate directions (off towards the side where the bear is coming from, and then down to the base of the bottle), and it creates an awkward feeling.  If the bear were peeping up from behind the bottle it might have worked better for me.  Overall, though, great concept!</td>', 'What''s with the stuffed animal?  I love the lighting on the toy, and you did a great job with the concept.  The framing feels awkward to me though, I feel as though I''m being pulled in two separate directions (off towards the side where the bear is coming from, and then down to the base of the bottle), and it creates an awkward feeling.  If the bear were peeping up from behind the bottle it might have worked better for me.  Overall, though, great concept!', '2009-11-07 11:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717616, 831000, 102019, '<td valign="top">Good concept. Better lighting on the product would have helped this shot -- it looks a little dark to me.</td>', 'Good concept. Better lighting on the product would have helped this shot -- it looks a little dark to me.', '2009-11-07 11:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717619, 831044, 102019, '<td valign="top">You get my vote for the brown ribbon -- which is impressive, considering that someone else entered a photo that didn''t have any liquid involved at all! Aren''t we supposed to be trying to "Sell" a beverage??<br/> <br/>Congratulations for winning the lowest score from me in this challenge.</td>', 'You get my vote for the brown ribbon -- which is impressive, considering that someone else entered a photo that didn''t have any liquid involved at all! Aren''t we supposed to be trying to "Sell" a beverage?? Congratulations for winning the lowest score from me in this challenge.', '2009-11-07 11:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717622, 830993, 102019, '<td valign="top">Using the rule of thirds might have created more movement and interest in this photo.  I like the surreal feel of this image, although the sky is the most interesting aspect and it doesn''t really make me thirsty.</td>', 'Using the rule of thirds might have created more movement and interest in this photo.  I like the surreal feel of this image, although the sky is the most interesting aspect and it doesn''t really make me thirsty.', '2009-11-07 11:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717648, 831070, 102019, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the position of the bottle.  It''s not exactly centered, and it''s not far enough over to the left to put it in that third of the frame, and so it creates an odd effect.</td>', 'I don''t like the position of the bottle.  It''s not exactly centered, and it''s not far enough over to the left to put it in that third of the frame, and so it creates an odd effect.', '2009-11-07 12:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717650, 831072, 102019, '<td valign="top">I think you missed the point of the challenge.  Why would I want to buy an empty bottle?</td>', 'I think you missed the point of the challenge.  Why would I want to buy an empty bottle?', '2009-11-07 12:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717651, 831049, 102019, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.</td>', 'I don''t get it.', '2009-11-07 12:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717656, 829988, 102019, '<td valign="top">This photo does make me thirsty, however, it makes me want a drink of water, not pepsi.  I think the problem is the can is getting over-powered by the rest of the photo.</td>', 'This photo does make me thirsty, however, it makes me want a drink of water, not pepsi.  I think the problem is the can is getting over-powered by the rest of the photo.', '2009-11-07 12:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717661, 830981, 102019, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the frame, but I like the rest.  I wonder, though, if this wouldn''t have popped more with a black background?</td>', 'I don''t like the frame, but I like the rest.  I wonder, though, if this wouldn''t have popped more with a black background?', '2009-11-07 12:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717662, 830465, 102019, '<td valign="top">If anything, this photo makes me want to buy a puppy, not a beer.</td>', 'If anything, this photo makes me want to buy a puppy, not a beer.', '2009-11-07 12:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717668, 831012, 102019, '<td valign="top">I believe that you wanted the focal point to be the bottle cap (so we can actually see what the "cold one" is), but the lighting is wrong.  The bottle cap should be the brightest part of the shot, but the strongest light isn''t coming from the front left.</td>', 'I believe that you wanted the focal point to be the bottle cap (so we can actually see what the "cold one" is), but the lighting is wrong.  The bottle cap should be the brightest part of the shot, but the strongest light isn''t coming from the front left.', '2009-11-07 12:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717671, 831036, 102019, '<td valign="top">Too dark</td>', 'Too dark', '2009-11-07 12:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717682, 831036, 75386, '<td valign="top">i dont see the italian style in the photo, but it is a very nice shot</td>', 'i dont see the italian style in the photo, but it is a very nice shot', '2009-11-07 13:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717924, 830975, 33672, '<td valign="top">With some of the themes that Mtn Dew Uses,this fits right in. Great tag line. Could use a darker back drop, condensationand less refelction on the product.</td>', 'With some of the themes that Mtn Dew Uses,this fits right in. Great tag line. Could use a darker back drop, condensationand less refelction on the product.', '2009-11-07 18:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717928, 830961, 33672, '<td valign="top">I could easily picture this as the final scene in a TV commercial. Ads aren''t always in Magazines or on billboards. Not that you control it but a blue sky would be more effective.</td>', 'I could easily picture this as the final scene in a TV commercial. Ads aren''t always in Magazines or on billboards. Not that you control it but a blue sky would be more effective.', '2009-11-07 18:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717930, 830369, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice work. You really nailed the ambiance of autumn. A bit of condensation and a full bottle would make the product more appealing.</td>', 'Nice work. You really nailed the ambiance of autumn. A bit of condensation and a full bottle would make the product more appealing.', '2009-11-07 18:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717934, 831011, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice color scheme. Condensation and a removed cap would add to the appeal of the product that is very well presented otherwise.</td>', 'Nice color scheme. Condensation and a removed cap would add to the appeal of the product that is very well presented otherwise.', '2009-11-07 18:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717937, 830999, 33672, '<td valign="top">Lighting and ambiance is perfect. Nice negative space leaves room for text. Sweet ad.</td>', 'Lighting and ambiance is perfect. Nice negative space leaves room for text. Sweet ad.', '2009-11-07 18:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717939, 830988, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the presentation of product. refelction catches my attention and draws me in. Nice comp leaves space for text on top. Very well done.</td>', 'I like the presentation of product. refelction catches my attention and draws me in. Nice comp leaves space for text on top. Very well done.', '2009-11-07 18:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717944, 830709, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very nicely presented. Ambiance is great with a comp that lends itself easily to text placement.</td>', 'Very nicely presented. Ambiance is great with a comp that lends itself easily to text placement.', '2009-11-07 18:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717952, 830959, 33672, '<td valign="top">nice work. original concept. A more direct "can to mouth" would make this more effective.</td>', 'nice work. original concept. A more direct "can to mouth" would make this more effective.', '2009-11-07 18:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717955, 830981, 33672, '<td valign="top">Sweet (no pun intended)ad.  A great concept that is well composed. Nice negative for possible text. A bit over exposed though. You want the orange color to grab the possible consumer.</td>', 'Sweet (no pun intended)ad.  A great concept that is well composed. Nice negative for possible text. A bit over exposed though. You want the orange color to grab the possible consumer.', '2009-11-07 18:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717959, 831000, 33672, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the theme. DOF and comp leaves room for possible text. unique situation (I.E. can hanging by a clothespin) really catches your attention. If I had a pick it would be to ask for a tighter crop to make the product more prominent.</td>', 'One of the best in the theme. DOF and comp leaves room for possible text. unique situation (I.E. can hanging by a clothespin) really catches your attention. If I had a pick it would be to ask for a tighter crop to make the product more prominent.', '2009-11-07 19:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717964, 831034, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. in the motiff of Corona. Great comp leaves room for effective text placement. My only pick would be to remove the cap. It would make the product more inviting. Maybe add a lime too.</td>', 'Nicely done. in the motiff of Corona. Great comp leaves room for effective text placement. My only pick would be to remove the cap. It would make the product more inviting. Maybe add a lime too.', '2009-11-07 19:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717996, 831034, 69450, '<td valign="top">wow that''s awesome!</td>', 'wow that''s awesome!', '2009-11-07 19:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718010, 831020, 69450, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2009-11-07 19:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718023, 830465, 111651, '<td valign="top">The only photo in this catagory that is not a typical still. Less is more.</td>', 'The only photo in this catagory that is not a typical still. Less is more.', '2009-11-07 19:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718062, 829988, 67697, '<td valign="top">This has to be the ribbon winner.  The lighting is awesome.  The splash is mesmerizing.  I love this shot!</td>', 'This has to be the ribbon winner.  The lighting is awesome.  The splash is mesmerizing.  I love this shot!', '2009-11-07 20:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
