(5720621, 831076, 73564, '<td valign="top">lol..I haven''t had a real problem with lighting in a while..or no comments about it. I was surprised nobody had said it looks crooked, because to me it does. I had wished I shot this with enough time to re shoot....but as always, by best shots come within an hour of rollover. That''s just how it goes for me. I was unsure about the crop myself, but without it, it really took the focus away from the background quite a bit. (imo) Thanks for all the wonderful comments and votes cast for this image.</td>', 'lol..I haven''t had a real problem with lighting in a while..or no comments about it. I was surprised nobody had said it looks crooked, because to me it does. I had wished I shot this with enough time to re shoot....but as always, by best shots come within an hour of rollover. That''s just how it goes for me. I was unsure about the crop myself, but without it, it really took the focus away from the background quite a bit. (imo) Thanks for all the wonderful comments and votes cast for this image.', '2009-11-09 15:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
